/scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974535_169047908250742_8418151156766296047_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-K29Jv4Mev0Q7kNvwEroEDi&_nc_oc=Ado8ur40ICRNE5u8h_6SkHDm3bwSomp9E8FO70OCfBnN8hDVtidiRWp0BfcVogo-rKM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSn_xHUzxsChwzVdFBW7938MUiA4jGSjHnn-oo6VhYRtQ&oe=6AFB4578"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_Image_Cover_2560x1440.png", "id": "418797219253351", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974555_418797222586684_516936567010903441_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mF8pekxgkNgQ7kNvwGR-Yya&_nc_oc=Adq6Za1Jp78lL0v-FKFVYF2ii87oKpp3yBun1-zZ8ijJ9Zc2G6tkYuk0BB682vz-HlM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ6Zk6Fc8pYHEWoc1NGZzkgHU3US-3B5qGDd1vUsVIlow&oe=6AFB4D00"}, "display_name": "DoVille Adventures", "keywords": [], "long_description": "DoVille Adventures has launched! Designed by a team that includes older, nostalgic adults, it's your vacation dream come true! Episode One, Juniper Beach, is a low poly BEACH adventure. Thrill to easy-to-use summer activities; catch the mysterious art thief and save the beach, or simply stretch out for an extended stay in the warm, warm sun. Take a dip, water ski, or ride the hot-air balloon. For more information (and even a report on the positive brain effects, visit doville dot fun). ", "short_description": "DoVille Adventures has launched! Here's one you can hand to Granny with your (old) Oculus Go. Designed by a team that includes older, nostalgic adults, it's your vacation dream come true! Episode One, Juniper Beach, is a low poly BEACH adventure. Thrill to easy-to-use activities; catch the mysterious art thief and save the beach, or simply stretch out for an extended stay in the warm, warm sun."}]}, "developer_name": "Project Whitecard Digital Inc.", "developer_privacy_policy_url":